  "translate_en|mods/simple-suppressors/42/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/Sandbox.json|Sandbox_SimpleSuppressors_LootRarity_tooltip": "Scales relative procedural-loot chances for suppressors and parts. 100 is the baseline; lower or higher values make entries less or more common approximately.",
