  "translate_en|mods/simple-suppressors/42/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/Sandbox.json|Sandbox_SimpleSuppressors_OilFilterWearMinutes_tooltip": "Driving with the oil filter removed damages the engine once per this many in-game minutes. The default is gradual wear: one condition every 10 minutes.",
