  "translate_en|mods/simple-suppressors/42/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/Sandbox.json|Sandbox_SimpleSuppressors_SoundRadiusReduction_tooltip": "How far zombies can hear a suppressed shot, as a percentage of the unsuppressed range. 20 means suppressed shots carry only a fifth as far. 100 disables the effect.",
