  "translate_en|mods/simple-suppressors/42/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/Sandbox.json|Sandbox_SimpleSuppressors_SoundVolumeReduction_tooltip": "How loud a suppressed shot is, as a percentage of the unsuppressed volume. 55 means suppressed shots are slightly more than half as loud. 100 disables the effect."
